node.text:
{{emote|*She tilts her head at you curiously.*}}

Power? As in the right of decree? To order those around me like servants? Or spout words of sovereignty?

No. What the people of this land do for me is out of love and respect. Nothing more.

The taste? Or maybe how the sheen and beauty of their shells appear as gemstones to some? There are many reasons that I might never know.

{{emote|*She holds a solemn stare, suffrage wracking her face as grief seems to deepen in her.*}}

I’m sorry, I see that was a painful question to ask.
